[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 17588.788, "timestamp": "04:53:08", "text": "快点。啊，这简直就是我。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17591.43, "timestamp": "04:53:11", "text": "大家好，发生了什么事？我在这里"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17594.628, "timestamp": "04:53:14", "text": "药剂师，我听到有人说哦"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17596.55, "timestamp": "04:53:16", "text": "你是警长之类的吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17598.628, "timestamp": "04:53:18", "text": "他们死了，是的，警长杀了一个人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17601.03, "timestamp": "04:53:21", "text": "无辜者互相残杀"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17609.91, "timestamp": "04:53:29", "text": "警长杀了我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17611.43, "timestamp": "04:53:31", "text": "其中一人是警长，他们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17612.708, "timestamp": "04:53:32", "text": "他们就像是“哦，我是警长”或者“你是……”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17614.15, "timestamp": "04:53:34", "text": "警长，他们说了些什么，警长"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17615.91, "timestamp": "04:53:35", "text": "然后，是的，他们两个都死了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17618.55, "timestamp": "04:53:38", "text": "当我真正结束考试的时候，那就是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17622.39, "timestamp": "04:53:42", "text": "她。出现了双杀。是的。什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17623.91, "timestamp": "04:53:43", "text": "你打算加倍下注吗？需要降温。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17625.83, "timestamp": "04:53:45", "text": "冷却时间过后，一名无辜者丧命。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17629.03, "timestamp": "04:53:49", "text": "那个人也死了。是的，就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17631.75, "timestamp": "04:53:51", "text": "速度太快，她来不及杀死他。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17636.39, "timestamp": "04:53:56", "text": "谁把事情搞复杂了，谁就能看到我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17638.39, "timestamp": "04:53:58", "text": "爱人是我的队友，他能看到我的角色。"}]